---
// Componente Hero idéntico al diseño original de SEOAI
---
<section style="background: #151922; color: #ffffff; padding: 60px 0 80px 0; font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; text-align: center;">
    <div style="max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 20px;">
        
        <!-- Badge superior de clientes -->
        <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; background: #1e222d; padding: 8px 18px; border-radius: 30px; margin-bottom: 25px; border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05);">
            <div style="display: flex; margin-right: 10px;">
                <span style="width: 24px; height: 24px; background: #cbd5e1; border-radius: 50%; display: inline-block; border: 2px solid #151922;"></span>
                <span style="width: 24px; height: 24px; background: #94a3b8; border-radius: 50%; display: inline-block; margin-left: -10px; border: 2px solid #151922;"></span>
                <span style="width: 24px; height: 24px; background: #64748b; border-radius: 50%; display: inline-block; margin-left: -10px; border: 2px solid #151922;"></span>
            </div>
            <span style="font-size: 14px; color: #cbd5e1; font-weight: 500;">500+ Startup Chose SEO</span>
        </div>

        <!-- Título Principal -->
        <h1 style="font-size: 56px; font-weight: 800; line-height: 1.15; margin-bottom: 25px; letter-spacing: -1px;">
            Rank Higher Get More Traffic and <span style="background: #6366f1; color: white; padding: 2px 16px; border-radius: 12px; display: inline-block; transform: rotate(-1deg);">Sales</span>
        </h1>

        <!-- Subtítulo -->
        <p style="font-size: 17px; color: #94a3b8; max-width: 650px; margin: 0 auto 35px auto; line-height: 1.6;">
            Our SEO strategies are built to perform. From increasing your search engine rankings to driving qualified traffic and boosting conversions.
        </p>

        <!-- Botón de acción -->
        <div style="margin-bottom: 60px;">
            <a href="/contact" style="background: #6366f1; color: white; padding: 16px 32px; border-radius: 30px; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; box-shadow: 0 8px 25px rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.4);">
                Talk To An SEO Expert
                <span style="background: white; width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%; display: inline-block;"></span>
            </a>
        </div>

        <!-- Caja inferior de Estadísticas -->
        <div style="background: #1e222d; border-radius: 24px; padding: 40px; border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); box-shadow: 0 15px 35px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);">
            <p style="font-size: 14px; color: #94a3b8; margin-bottom: 30px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1px;">
                Trusted by <strong style="color: #ffffff;">5000+</strong> Brands That Value Real Results
            </p>

            <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); gap: 20px; text-align: center;">
                <div>
                    <h2 style="font-size: 38px; font-weight: 800; color: #ffffff; margin: 0 0 5px 0;">25<span style="color: #6366f1;">+</span></h2>
                    <p style="font-size: 14px; color: #94a3b8; margin: 0;">Projects Completed</p>
                </div>
                <div style="border-left: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);">
                    <h2 style="font-size: 38px; font-weight: 800; color: #ffffff; margin: 0 0 5px 0;">1.2<span style="color: #6366f1;">K+</span></h2>
                    <p style="font-size: 14px; color: #94a3b8; margin: 0;">Keywords Ranked</p>
                </div>
                <div style="border-left: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);">
                    <h2 style="font-size: 38px; font-weight: 800; color: #ffffff; margin: 0 0 5px 0;">95<span style="color: #6366f1;">%</span></h2>
                    <p style="font-size: 14px; color: #94a3b8; margin: 0;">Increase Conversion</p>
                </div>
                <div style="border-left: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);">
                    <h2 style="font-size: 38px; font-weight: 800; color: #ffffff; margin: 0 0 5px 0;">15<span style="color: #6366f1;">+</span></h2>
                    <p style="font-size: 14px; color: #94a3b8; margin: 0;">Years Experience</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

    </div>
</section>